{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a Space Journey with Spacecraft.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can control your spacecraft using the W, A, S, D, Space, and Shift keys to move. You can also use Q, E, and the arrow keys to rotate your spacecraft. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Holding the Z key activates the brake, allowing you to bring your spacecraft to a stop. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All movement consumes fuel, and if you run out of fuel, your spacecraft will be destroyed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your spacecraft can only operate within the signal range provided by Beacons, so be careful not to drift out of range. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid asteroids, debris, and lasers that stand in your way, and keep moving forward. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the ESC key to adjust video, audio, and control settings.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Journey Begins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3553890/d5e74f7abce4973db08e3a80ace6d3e859bf5377.jpg"},{"name":"Flight Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3553890/69bddefe13f245327d25e20c6a5e117d448ee37c.jpg"},{"name":"The Challenge Begins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3553890/4324a770681ac4fefcc181611f27c5c23be252f1.jpg"},{"name":"Master of 6-DoF","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3553890/fc79585423ffe5e8a6f4e4b58f9f30a4bb9d42fa.jpg"},{"name":"Need to Charge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3553890/9494b17c2c50af53ce0486f36d4c7b4faa5f5e7b.jpg"},{"name":"No Signal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3553890/cfdbb6c589e85c51dcbef1ba3148a392c503c993.jpg"},{"name":"Target Locked","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3553890/94e9c0dd1286146c